{#- PostHog with its standard first-party cookie. Cookieless mode was rejected on
    2026-10-01: PostHog strips the IP in that mode, which loses country/city and bot
    detection. Only the hosts in data/analytics.json report, and every event carries
    an environment (production or homelab) so cluster testing filters out of the
    real numbers; Netlify previews and localhost send nothing. The project key is PostHog's public browser key, not a secret. -#}
{%- set ph = analytics.posthog %}
<script>
